{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"501739c9dc7ed493e1fc8eef2d05f34132403f2e5dc642d2315a63330a146231","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"a7c20343e019cce5d4df8b82cc25c868d4ba6f6257b3331ad8640c80d2b0ecf1","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/lore/slumbering-caves.lua:70-94（未固定来源，快照 736deaf7）：多处语义偏离。(1) L75 \"wrath shall be delectable\"（愤怒将是甘美可口的）被译成「将无可抵挡」，意思变了。(2) L72/73 \"is nigh\" 表示将至，译文「已经降临」「已经敲响」把尚未到来说成已完成。(3) L89 \"we will find the heretics together\" 被译成「我们将亲自对背教者发动复仇」，丢了 together（一起），把 find 改写成复仇。(4) L84 \"Your vision will be seen on Eyal once more\" 被译成「你的愿景将会重新改变整个埃亚尔」，把「再次显现于」改成了「改变」。此外 L76-78 添加了原文没有的「美丽」「美好」「蠢材」「他复活的」。"},{"revision_key":"a7d3a8df22f2b82ee20d41d039e3fdb864ac4f2d929468a57026d9c24f0cf9ce","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"a87cc074189917d74468c64bc87817a3c69cfd42f49f16d32b51f93621f3c3c7","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"a9d2942514aebb65224ae0806a4725fdcb5d5abcda0e188bb8ddc492555d5fe7","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/lore/sunwall.lua:105（未固定来源）：lore 名称 \"a torn page from John's journal\" 被译成「约翰日记上的一页」，漏了 torn（撕下的／残页）。建议译作「约翰日记中撕下的一页」之类。"},{"revision_key":"ab005d53a8a9ce237b391f31a1e77297bead08c229d1cacd3c4f5dbcf0f17c50","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/chats/weissi-machine.lua:60-61（未固定来源）：\"reward you with petty knowledge\" 被译成「传授你知识」，漏了 petty（微不足道的）。原文刻画 Weissi 的傲慢和轻蔑，下一句回应 \"That is... generous of you.\" 的反讽就依赖这层轻蔑，删掉后语气不再连贯。"},{"revision_key":"ac38d13dc57f0dfd674cae664fe1acfc460074be2207a9adb2b1b49d8726276a","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua:746（未固定来源）：special_on_crit desc 明确写明 \"dealing physical damage equal to 25% of the original damage\"，译文「造成25%原伤害值的伤害」漏了伤害类型「物理」。应为「造成相当于原伤害25%的物理伤害」。"},{"revision_key":"ac986bd586ae5c6fe2e37037e175e03a739b6f0c7571630799cdad1d98e50cd5","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"acd4f8ee23c9a291bca9d16d3f194e39fe86647ce0887fe71d35413f530519fc","verdict":"OK"}]}